      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Better yet, just autoban unathorized private avatar ID users. The only way a player can use a private avatar while not being the uploader is through hacks. Instant grounds for a permban and it stops the issue right in its tracks. If you want 'approved' people using your avatar, just make it public and have a private avatar world or let them upload it to their account themself.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
