      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b4ccf8a0748001de96568e6|full_name}: autobans are NEVER the way to go in an indie-developed app or game. In a game like VRChat where it's full of exploits, I feel an autoban will completely kill the game after banning everyone.\n\nBut I do feel though as if @OP (Ivan) is on to something there!",
